WEBVTT

00:14.774 --> 00:21.114
Deai wa kitto kokoro no yoake

00:21.114 --> 00:27.454
Atarashii kaze ga soko kara umareru

00:27.454 --> 00:33.894
Hitori ja nai to kizuita toki ni

00:33.894 --> 00:40.404
Tsukitooru tsuki wa hohemi wo kureru

00:40.404 --> 00:46.774
Sono toki tamashii ni kikoeru prelude wa

00:46.774 --> 00:52.944
Natsukashikute, tada fushigi na uta

00:52.944 --> 00:56.154
We are not alone

00:56.154 --> 00:59.324
Hito wa minna

00:59.324 --> 01:07.494
Dareka to deau tame umarete kuru, kitto

01:07.494 --> 01:15.174
Ah, hateshinai kono sekai e

01:15.174 --> 01:23.474
Sou, ai wo sagasu tame ni

02:20.774 --> 02:22.734
I have come to speak with you.

02:22.734 --> 02:24.204
- Final Episode-
The Princess and...

02:24.204 --> 02:25.774
- Final Episode-
The Princess and...
The Princess and...

02:25.774 --> 02:28.714
- Final Episode-
The Princess and...

02:29.644 --> 02:32.044
You would "speak" though you
should be in confinement?

02:32.414 --> 02:36.414
Yes. Because it is of utmost importance
to both the Moon and the Earth

02:36.414 --> 02:38.474
I would have you listen to us now.

02:38.724 --> 02:41.714
And that person is the man
that Karen approved of?

02:42.324 --> 02:45.064
It is an honor to meet you, Your Excellency.

02:45.064 --> 02:47.564
I am Tatsuya Asagiri. Feena's-

02:47.564 --> 02:49.254
He is my partner!

02:49.594 --> 02:51.764
An Earthling for a partner?!

02:51.764 --> 02:53.754
I thought Lord Jurgen was the Princess's...

02:54.274 --> 02:56.174
Do it, staff.

02:58.404 --> 03:02.004
Our feed's been interrupted
by an ultra-powerful signal!

03:02.214 --> 03:03.714
Sayaka, this is...

03:03.714 --> 03:06.514
Yes. The lunar royal palace.

03:09.784 --> 03:11.124
It's started, eh?

03:11.124 --> 03:12.744
Do it, Tatsuya!

03:12.954 --> 03:15.584
What's Asagiri doing on the Moon?!

03:17.924 --> 03:19.464
Miss Feena...

03:19.464 --> 03:21.634
She isn't studying on Earth?

03:21.634 --> 03:24.604
She and that boy are friends.

03:24.964 --> 03:27.064
Look, they're holding hands!

03:27.704 --> 03:28.804
Right now, no matter what,

03:28.804 --> 03:33.744
I want to avoid the unprecedented danger
that faces both the Moon and the Earth.

03:33.744 --> 03:34.834
To that end...

03:35.144 --> 03:37.614
I propose that the lunar fleet
immediately pull back,

03:37.614 --> 03:39.544
we reconcile with the Federation Government...

03:40.044 --> 03:44.574
...and both worlds establish
unconditional diplomatic relations.

03:45.124 --> 03:46.924
Diplomatic relations?!

03:46.924 --> 03:47.824
Absurd!

03:48.094 --> 03:53.254
It's not difficult. Both sides need only
lower their swords and extend their hands.

03:53.564 --> 03:55.824
Is that not all it is?

03:56.134 --> 04:00.434
You would say that knowing the part
you two have played in causing this?

04:00.434 --> 04:04.904
Of course, we are aware that we cannot
escape the responsibility for that.

04:04.904 --> 04:09.414
We know full well the great responsibility
we hold in risking life and livelihood

04:09.414 --> 04:11.974
for the sake of friendship
between our two worlds.

04:12.514 --> 04:16.814
In the past as well, there were some
who shared that same resolve.

04:16.814 --> 04:20.314
And yet, you know the real reason that
interplanetary relations began, yes?

04:21.424 --> 04:23.324
The Oedipus War.

04:23.494 --> 04:27.364
There are many who forget
the happenings of the past.

04:27.364 --> 04:32.734
But there are also those who CANNOT forget
the scars, the agony of the past!

04:32.734 --> 04:34.064
Miss Fiacca...

04:34.404 --> 04:35.834
Unless we tread delicately,

04:35.834 --> 04:39.564
relations between our worlds could create
the spark that leads to another war!

04:40.174 --> 04:43.574
We cannot repeat the same mistake!

04:46.884 --> 04:50.314
On Earth, we encountered a young girl.

04:51.224 --> 04:55.024
It's because people forget that they
repeat the same mistakes...

04:55.024 --> 04:56.824
That's what she said.

04:57.364 --> 05:01.234
And that when people of the Moon
and the Earth draw closer,

05:01.234 --> 05:04.094
both sides clash, again causing war.

05:04.664 --> 05:07.194
However, we do not think so!

05:07.774 --> 05:12.044
No matter how badly hurt, or how great the pain,
the wound shall always heal.

05:12.044 --> 05:17.114
Not by forgetting, but by overcoming and
ensuring the same mistakes are not made.

05:17.114 --> 05:21.884
The past cannot be changed. But a future,
one that is full of hope, can be created.

05:29.254 --> 05:33.994
Please! Don't let the anger of the past
deny the future!

05:36.264 --> 05:40.234
Why do you place such importance for
the future on relations with the Earth?

05:40.234 --> 05:43.174
Because you wish to have
that person there as your partner?

05:43.174 --> 05:45.694
That is not the only reason.

05:46.274 --> 05:53.074
Long ago, that shining blue star was our home,
and I love it. I love Earth.

05:54.354 --> 05:59.444
I met Tatsuya there as a child,
and found my way to him again...

05:59.924 --> 06:04.164
In cities and in schools, the people
were warm and generous...

06:04.164 --> 06:07.564
They looked after me, supported me,
enveloped me in kindness

06:07.564 --> 06:09.964
and gave me many wonderful memories.

06:12.204 --> 06:17.634
I think so very fondly of Earth
and the people that live there.

06:17.904 --> 06:19.904
I'm watching her, Sefiria.

06:19.904 --> 06:20.914
Miss Feena...

06:20.914 --> 06:22.914
Long live Princess Feena!

06:22.914 --> 06:25.884
We love Feena, too!

06:28.314 --> 06:30.474
Feena's so cool!

06:30.684 --> 06:37.494
I want the people of my beloved kingdom
to know of my happiness as well. And...

06:37.494 --> 06:39.984
I want them to envision a wonderful future!

06:41.634 --> 06:45.694
This is what you learned and acquired
while living on Earth?

06:46.064 --> 06:49.774
Yes. My mother left this world
with her dream still unfulfilled...

06:49.774 --> 06:53.204
At some point in time, the dream became mine.

06:53.844 --> 06:56.574
Together with my partner, who wants
to realize this dream with me,

06:56.574 --> 06:59.944
I want to forge a new future
for the Moon and the Earth!

07:00.244 --> 07:05.444
How idealistic. But ever does the enemy
stand in the way of that idealism.

07:06.024 --> 07:09.524
That is precisely why we came here.

07:09.524 --> 07:13.594
To walk toward, to fight for a future
only dreamed of. And...

07:13.594 --> 07:16.254
And to protect Feena, even if it costs me my life.

07:18.334 --> 07:23.574
So please! Find it in yourself
to approve our relationship!

07:23.574 --> 07:27.474
Please forgive us who we love,
and for finding happiness in life.

07:34.984 --> 07:37.284
That was quite enjoyable.

07:37.384 --> 07:40.154
However, let us end this charade here.

07:42.454 --> 07:46.324
Your Excellency, so that Miss Feena
is not corrupted any further

07:46.324 --> 07:49.064
we should take the appropriate
action to censure her...

07:49.064 --> 07:50.234
Be silent!

07:50.234 --> 07:51.254
I will not.

07:51.834 --> 07:55.974
I can take no more of this groveling
toward the Earth.

07:55.974 --> 07:59.234
What is needed now is military strength.

08:01.844 --> 08:03.814
What is the meaning of this, Jurgen?

08:04.044 --> 08:09.784
The Earth will now be destroyed...
And we shall finally have true peace.

08:09.784 --> 08:11.354
That is what it means.

08:11.354 --> 08:15.524
Madness! If that is the case,
the Earth will not simply stand silent!

08:15.524 --> 08:20.824
You would repeat the tragedy of the war?!
This time it shall destroy us both!

08:21.064 --> 08:24.054
No. For we have THIS.

08:28.734 --> 08:30.864
It can't be! Is that...

08:37.684 --> 08:39.384
A Meteor fall!

08:39.384 --> 08:43.714
How? Construction of that devilish weapon
was banned by the Oedipus Peace Treaty!

08:43.954 --> 08:49.854
Using the power of the House of Kruger,
it was easy to have it built in secret.

08:50.054 --> 08:52.854
However, there is no need to
keep it hidden any longer!

09:00.064 --> 09:01.334
Jurgen!

09:03.034 --> 09:05.674
Enough of your foolish talk.

09:05.674 --> 09:10.474
The only "splendid future" you shall have
is the one created by I, Jurgen!

09:13.854 --> 09:16.214
A madness bordering on hatred...

09:16.354 --> 09:19.784
It is the same as that which long ago
caused my birth.

09:19.784 --> 09:21.154
Miss Fiacca...

09:24.664 --> 09:26.154
Brother!

09:31.264 --> 09:34.934
Do you realize what you are doing, Jurgen?!

09:34.934 --> 09:36.574
Of course.

09:36.574 --> 09:40.944
And while it's been humiliating enough
to serve a king who once was a commoner,

09:40.944 --> 09:44.484
that girl's idiot hope for relations with the Earth

09:44.484 --> 09:47.244
and her attempt to introduce
an Earthling as a partner...

09:47.514 --> 09:49.484
I can take no more!

09:49.754 --> 09:52.344
Why do you reject Earth so?

09:52.554 --> 09:55.724
A little girl smitten with the Earth
would never understand.

09:55.724 --> 09:59.464
The overpowering pressure it exerts as it looks
down upon the people of the Moon...

09:59.464 --> 10:02.724
The fear of that blue, icy-looking star!

10:02.894 --> 10:06.134
Earth is the homeworld
of the people of the Moon!

10:06.134 --> 10:08.534
Why should there be need to fear it?

10:08.534 --> 10:10.644
Then why did the war start?

10:10.644 --> 10:13.574
Because neither knew the other,
and were afraid!

10:15.574 --> 10:18.744
Without a doubt, that was because
they lacked courage.

10:18.984 --> 10:20.114
What?!

10:20.114 --> 10:24.284
Touch each other and both are human, with
the same warm blood running through them.

10:24.284 --> 10:28.424
Earth is a planet enveloped in warmth,
and you know this. And yet...

10:28.424 --> 10:30.194
Earth people are the same.

10:30.194 --> 10:33.894
Even though, when seen from the night sky,
the Moon is a friendly star,

10:33.894 --> 10:36.364
giving off its faint light as
it looks down over us. Yet...

10:36.494 --> 10:39.604
That's why we'll show you it can be done.

10:39.604 --> 10:42.364
So that everyone can try to have
just a little courage!

10:43.504 --> 10:46.304
Impudent little girl!

10:46.304 --> 10:50.014
I thought I would make use of you,
supported as you are by the people,

10:50.014 --> 10:51.514
but I have changed my mind.

10:51.514 --> 10:55.104
I will have you pay for all the Earth's sins!

10:55.514 --> 10:57.144
You are inhuman!

10:58.224 --> 11:01.754
My, my. You're pretty unlucky, ain't ya?

11:01.754 --> 11:05.154
This wasn't what it were supposed to be for,
but they sure did come in handy.

11:05.324 --> 11:06.124
Staff!

11:06.124 --> 11:07.394
Yes, Boss!

11:09.234 --> 11:10.804
What is this?!

11:10.804 --> 11:15.764
Your treachery has been broadcast
all throughout space, Jurgen!

11:27.514 --> 11:29.344
Karen Clavius...

11:29.454 --> 11:30.444
Karen!

11:30.854 --> 11:33.444
I apologize for my lateness, Your Excellency.

11:35.854 --> 11:38.864
You fancy yourself a tactician, but there is
little depth to you at all, is there?

11:38.864 --> 11:40.624
Heir to the House of Kruger...

11:40.934 --> 11:44.624
My subordinates have already disabled
that dangerous trump card of yours.

11:47.504 --> 11:48.474
Take him away!

11:48.474 --> 11:49.404
Ma'am!

12:01.914 --> 12:04.814
I AM KING!

12:16.164 --> 12:17.154
Tatsuya!

12:18.364 --> 12:19.804
Tatsuya!

12:24.074 --> 12:25.564
Feena...

12:26.074 --> 12:28.544
Are you... injured?

12:28.544 --> 12:31.034
I'm fine. But you...

12:31.244 --> 12:36.314
You're okay... aren't you? I'm glad...

12:38.624 --> 12:40.554
Tatsuya...

12:41.154 --> 12:42.284
Tatsuya...

12:48.494 --> 12:57.334
Tsunaida kono te wo hanasazu ni ite
Stay here and don't let go of this hand you've clasped

12:57.334 --> 13:06.044
Shiawasaesugiru to kowaku naru kara
Because if I'm too happy I'll get frightened

13:06.044 --> 13:14.924
Konna ni ai seru hito
There is only one person in this world

13:14.924 --> 13:24.264
Sekai de tatta hitori
I can love this much

13:24.604 --> 13:26.464
I...

13:28.604 --> 13:31.804
You're my... You're my...

13:32.204 --> 13:34.304
Tatsuya!

13:47.554 --> 13:51.954
That boy... He kept his promise
and protected the Princess.

13:56.334 --> 14:03.394
I never wanted you to know this sadness.
That's why I... I...

14:05.974 --> 14:11.284
Excellency! A giant spacecraft has suddenly
appeared between the Terran and lunar fleets!

14:11.284 --> 14:13.244
Your orders, Sir!

14:13.714 --> 14:15.244
Put it on the monitor.

14:16.854 --> 14:18.444
What is that?!

14:25.164 --> 14:26.564
What is it?

14:26.564 --> 14:28.064
A lunar weapon?!

14:28.064 --> 14:31.734
Calm yourselves! We still don't know
that it's an enemy.

14:31.734 --> 14:33.134
It's THAT.

14:33.604 --> 14:37.744
I think it has to do with that top-secret file
about unidentified flying objects.

14:37.744 --> 14:41.874
Indeed. There's no way something this large
could have been built on the Moon.

15:04.834 --> 15:07.594
Feena... Why are you crying?

15:09.674 --> 15:11.004
Tatsuya!

15:11.004 --> 15:13.604
Tatsuya! Tatsuya!

15:14.074 --> 15:17.614
I'm sorry, Feena. It looks like I had you
worrying about something.

15:17.614 --> 15:20.444
That was cutting it close, eh Tatsuya?

15:25.984 --> 15:27.354
It's been a while.

15:27.854 --> 15:29.224
Chi...

15:29.224 --> 15:30.214
Chiharu!

15:30.554 --> 15:32.124
Uncle!

15:32.124 --> 15:33.454
Dad!

15:33.624 --> 15:36.184
Pops! What're you doing here?

15:36.334 --> 15:41.334
Well, I was out exploring some alien relics
and ended up getting abducted.

15:41.334 --> 15:44.934
I figured while I had the chance,
I might as well travel with 'em through space.

15:45.044 --> 15:48.164
You... Wait, it's YOU!

15:48.274 --> 15:50.514
Hey there, Lyones.

15:50.514 --> 15:53.034
You've turned into a first-rate king, huh?

15:53.814 --> 15:55.354
But why are you?

15:55.354 --> 15:58.284
We picked up your transmission just now.

15:58.284 --> 16:01.654
I saw some old familiar faces
and thought I'd pop in for a look.

16:01.654 --> 16:04.024
I'm just glad we got here in time!

16:04.824 --> 16:07.524
My son's quite the catch, you know!

16:08.734 --> 16:13.664
But if that were to again to lead to this sort
of incident, Feena would...

16:13.664 --> 16:15.894
I would... I...

16:16.174 --> 16:17.634
Sefiria!

16:17.974 --> 16:19.494
Father...

16:27.044 --> 16:29.584
l-it's Sefiria!

16:29.584 --> 16:33.924
It's meant to be listened to when Feena
meets the one she wants to be with.

16:33.924 --> 16:35.394
Mother's last words...

16:35.594 --> 16:37.594
Congratulations, Feena.

16:37.594 --> 16:40.424
I assume the young man by your side now

16:40.424 --> 16:43.154
will walk with you, no matter
what obstacle must be faced...

16:43.494 --> 16:47.164
That he is your partner, who will work
with you to achieve your dreams.

16:47.364 --> 16:50.034
The one who to you is Lyones to me.

16:51.204 --> 16:56.874
It's thanks to your father that I've lived
the fullest and happiest life!

16:58.814 --> 17:02.584
I pray that you will be visited by
the same kind of happiness.

17:03.014 --> 17:07.154
Your father is a little too serious,
so there may be a bump or two along the way,

17:07.154 --> 17:09.424
but do your best, Feena.

17:10.964 --> 17:12.584
Mother...

17:14.994 --> 17:17.324
Feena. And Tatsuya.

17:18.564 --> 17:21.274
There will be many obstacles
that must be overcome.

17:21.274 --> 17:23.834
Will you be able to hold fast to your ideals?

17:26.944 --> 17:27.904
Yes.

17:29.574 --> 17:31.414
Recall the fleet!

17:31.414 --> 17:34.404
Then contact the Earth government
to begin diplomatic relations!

17:34.714 --> 17:35.414
Yes, sir.

17:35.614 --> 17:37.514
Madam Princess!

17:38.324 --> 17:39.284
Mia!

17:39.284 --> 17:40.924
Way to go, Tatsuya!

17:40.924 --> 17:42.014
Uh...

17:44.194 --> 17:47.064
They did it. Those kids...

17:47.064 --> 17:48.824
Yes... Yes...

17:51.604 --> 17:54.264
Tatsuya! Feena!

18:05.214 --> 18:06.814
Are you leaving now?

18:06.814 --> 18:10.684
The curse of the past has been broken,
and I have seen the future.

18:10.814 --> 18:12.304
I have no regrets.

18:16.194 --> 18:18.594
Thank you, Wreathlit.

18:18.724 --> 18:21.134
Happiness lies in the future of all of you.

18:21.134 --> 18:22.624
Miss Fiacca...

18:22.764 --> 18:23.924
Farewell.

18:26.804 --> 18:29.634
Goodbye, Miss Fiacca.

18:40.084 --> 18:42.984
Hey, Nishioka! Camera 6 is broken!

18:42.984 --> 18:44.154
Do something!

18:44.154 --> 18:45.274
Yes, Boss!

18:45.654 --> 18:46.654
Staff!

18:46.654 --> 18:47.984
Yes, Boss!

18:50.894 --> 18:53.194
Ah, Wreath!

18:53.764 --> 18:55.224
Over here!

18:55.394 --> 18:57.804
Thank you for coming.

18:57.804 --> 18:58.064
King

18:58.064 --> 18:58.764
King
Pawn

18:58.964 --> 19:01.504
Again?! Wait just a minute, Chiharu!

19:01.504 --> 19:04.774
There'll be no waiting, thank you.
How many games is this, Lyones?

19:04.774 --> 19:06.304
Come on...

19:06.304 --> 19:07.774
Where is Sayaka?

19:07.774 --> 19:10.474
Oh, right now she's at the President's seat-

19:10.474 --> 19:12.174
Wreeaaath!

19:12.844 --> 19:14.874
Wreeeeeeaaaaath!!

19:15.754 --> 19:17.684
Let go!

19:17.684 --> 19:19.684
You're heavy! Stop that!

19:19.684 --> 19:20.284
Wreath! Wreath!

19:20.284 --> 19:23.694
Anyway, Wreath's height
hasn't changed at all, as it?
Wreath! Wreath!

19:23.694 --> 19:27.324
Exactly! Just like the way your
cooking skills haven't changed!

19:27.324 --> 19:30.194
Aim to be the greatest
Master Carbonizer in the universe!

19:30.194 --> 19:32.734
Jin. You never change, do you?

19:32.734 --> 19:36.174
Ah! It's Mother, who left home
to go study cooking...

19:38.744 --> 19:42.004
A mother's love, wide as the sky
and boundless as the univer-

19:42.944 --> 19:44.504
Ow...

19:51.384 --> 19:51.524
With Thoughts
of My Son

19:51.524 --> 19:57.624
With Thoughts
of My Son
Jin! If you add the aliens' bill, your loan's
just crossed the $3 million mark!

19:57.624 --> 19:58.164
With Thoughts
of My Son
Our apologies for the wait.

19:58.164 --> 19:59.894
Our apologies for the wait.

19:59.894 --> 20:03.094
But now, the bride and groom
shall make their appearance.

20:51.344 --> 20:53.244
We finally made it here, huh?

20:53.244 --> 20:55.304
Yes...

20:56.954 --> 20:58.284
What's wrong?

20:58.284 --> 21:01.594
I'm happy. We've realized my mother's dream:

21:01.594 --> 21:04.684
Normalized relations between
the Moon and the Earth.

21:05.324 --> 21:08.264
And made so many new friends...

21:09.164 --> 21:12.934
Going forward, interstellar diplomacy
is going to keep you pretty busy, huh?

21:14.574 --> 21:17.634
I'll be counting on your support, Tatsuya.

21:18.674 --> 21:22.634
I'll support you with all my strength
for the rest of our lives, Feena.

21:22.744 --> 21:23.974
I swear!

22:08.554 --> 22:13.324
Kurayami wo terashite
The Moon illuminates the darkness

22:13.324 --> 22:23.564
Tada chijou wo mitsumeteru tsuki
And simply stares at the Earth

22:24.374 --> 22:28.514
Watashi mo sonna
I want to be like that too

22:28.514 --> 22:34.144
Kono manazashi de kitto
And with this look

22:34.614 --> 22:46.184
Anato no koto wo mimamoritai no, itsudemo
To protect you, forever and always

22:46.624 --> 22:54.434
Anato to deai, hajimete shitta
Meeting you was when I first knew heartache

22:54.434 --> 23:02.474
Setsunasa ga hoho nurashite yuku kedo
And though it now moistens my cheeks

23:02.474 --> 23:10.514
Mae dake wo mite aruite itai
I want to walk, looking only ahead

23:10.514 --> 23:22.654
Donna toki demo, kokoro ni kagayaki idaite
Always holding fast to the glow within my heart
